<section class="chapter editorial-section">
  <div class="chapter-rule" data-reveal-line aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="editorial-head-center" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 40ms">
    <p class="section-eyebrow">WHY MURM</p>
    <h2 class="editorial-heading">Write the harness, not the plumbing</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="pillars-four">
    <article class="truth-item" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
      <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="9" y="4" width="6" height="4" />
        <rect x="4" y="16" width="6" height="4" />
        <rect x="14" y="16" width="6" height="4" />
        <rect x="11" y="8" width="2" height="4" />
        <rect x="6" y="12" width="12" height="2" />
        <rect x="6" y="14" width="2" height="2" />
        <rect x="16" y="14" width="2" height="2" />
      </svg>
      <h3>Any topology, zero rewrites</h3>
      <p>Subagents, task pools, peer meshes, or citation graphs — swap the harness, never the runtime.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="truth-item" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 190ms">
      <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="6" y="5" width="12" height="2" />
        <rect x="4" y="7" width="2" height="7" />
        <rect x="18" y="7" width="2" height="7" />
        <rect x="6" y="14" width="2" height="3" />
        <rect x="16" y="14" width="2" height="3" />
        <rect x="8" y="17" width="2" height="2" />
        <rect x="14" y="17" width="2" height="2" />
        <rect x="10" y="19" width="4" height="2" />
      </svg>
      <h3>Real isolation, built in</h3>
      <p>Every agent runs in its own sandbox with strict quotas. API keys never leave the host.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="truth-item" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 280ms">
      <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="3" y="9" width="5" height="6" />
        <rect x="16" y="5" width="5" height="4" />
        <rect x="16" y="15" width="5" height="4" />
        <rect x="8" y="11" width="5" height="2" />
        <rect x="11" y="6" width="2" height="12" />
        <rect x="13" y="6" width="3" height="2" />
        <rect x="13" y="16" width="3" height="2" />
      </svg>
      <h3>Services, not glue code</h3>
      <p>Plug in a task board, Git repo, or formal verifier without touching the underlying agent.</p>
    </article>

    <article class="truth-item" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay: 370ms">
      <svg class="px-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="currentColor" shape-rendering="crispEdges" aria-hidden="true">
        <rect x="5" y="4" width="14" height="2" />
        <rect x="5" y="18" width="14" height="2" />
        <rect x="5" y="6" width="2" height="12" />
        <rect x="17" y="6" width="2" height="12" />
        <rect x="9" y="8" width="6" height="2" />
        <rect x="9" y="11" width="6" height="2" opacity="0.65" />
        <rect x="9" y="14" width="4" height="2" opacity="0.65" />
      </svg>
      <h3>Reproducible by design</h3>
      <p>Sessions, model calls, and traces archive cleanly to disk before containers shut down.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
